    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 4, a forgotten slice of the neon-drenched metropolis. You are a rogue hacker trapped in a decommissioned megacorp server room. Outside, corporate security drones are sweeping the perimeter, and your only way out is to compile the legendary Master Code—a mythical script that can override the sector's lockdown protocols. The room is filled with old computing rigs, biological interface modules, and encrypted data drives left behind by the previous network administrator. You must navigate the maze of decryption layers and bypass intricate routing algorithms to extract the final escape code before the drones breach the reinforced door. The hum of cooling fans is your only company. Time is ticking.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
  },
